{"nodes": [{"id": "readme_nft_wallet", "label": "NFT Wallet (native Android)", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "L1-L9", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Full-suite Minima companion wallet reproducing the old official Wallet's 2.47.2-era feature set in native Java, plus regular NFT minting and State NFT locked-edition collections."}, {"id": "readme_minimaapi_aar_ipc", "label": "minimaapi.aar broadcast-Intent IPC", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "L7-L9", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The only channel to the node: no embedded node and no local keys, so the node itself signs via `txnsign publickey:auto`."}, {"id": "readme_minima_core_node_apk", "label": "Minima Core node APK (org.minimarex.minimacore)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "L7", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "readme_balances_tab", "label": "Balances tab", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "L15", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Carries sendable/confirmed/unconfirmed on every card, verified + web-validation badges, hidden tokens, and a token detail sheet with a contract viewer that detects StateNFTs and a per-token coin explorer."}, {"id": "readme_gallery_tab", "label": "Gallery tab (two-column NFT grid)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "L16", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Regular NFTs get one card per token, but StateNFT collections get one card per owned item showing its sealed #index \u2014 because each item is a distinct coin, not a distinct token."}, {"id": "readme_mint_tab", "label": "Mint tab (Token \u00b7 NFT \u00b7 State NFT collection)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "L17", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "State NFT collections are 2\u201320 items with embed \u22648000-b64 per item or a URL base+index, built by a resumable CREATE\u2192MOVE\u2192SPLIT\u2192STAMP engine with live progress."}, {"id": "readme_statenft_mint_engine", "label": "Resumable CREATE\u2192MOVE\u2192SPLIT\u2192STAMP mint engine", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "L17", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Multi-transaction collection creation must survive interruption, so the engine is staged and resumable rather than a single atomic post."}, {"id": "readme_send_tab", "label": "Send tab (QUICK SEND + COIN CONTROL)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "L18", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "readme_receive_tab", "label": "Receive tab (QR, Mx + 0x, checkaddress report)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "L19", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "readme_coins_tab", "label": "Coins tab (UTXO coin picker)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "L20", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "readme_history_tab", "label": "History tab (adaptive `history max:8` paging)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "L21", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Bounded paging exists to never overload the node / blow the IPC message ceiling; rows are persisted locally with filters, detail breakdown and CSV/JSON export."}, {"id": "readme_dual_theme", "label": "Dual theme \u2014 family dark \u2194 old-wallet clean light", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "L23", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "All four Design modes exposed in Settings from day one rather than retrofitted."}, {"id": "readme_statenft_protocol", "label": "StateNFT protocol (locked-edition)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "L25-L34", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Byte-exact contract proven on-chain in mds/statenft-suite: sentinel state 0, creator bypass live only while unstamped, SAMESTATE(0 0|0 1) + VERIFYOUT(@INPUT GETOUTADDR(@INPUT) @AMOUNT @TOKENID TRUE)."}, {"id": "readme_state_port_replay", "label": "Verbatim state-port replay on every move", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "L29-L31", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "StateNFT coins are sendable:0, so every move is a manual txn that replays EVERY state port with storestate:true; values are sanitized against ^[0-9]+$ / ^\\[b64\\]$ before replay."}, {"id": "readme_txnpost_status_distrust", "label": "txnpost status:true is never trusted", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "L32", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The only accepted proof of success is the input coin leaving the UTXO set \u2014 a reported status can be true while the txn never lands."}, {"id": "readme_txndelete_discipline", "label": "txndelete on every path + \u22643 token outputs with halving", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "L33", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Abandoned txn ids otherwise accumulate in the node; output count is capped at 3 and halved on 'size too large' to stay under the post-size ceiling."}, {"id": "readme_unstamped_transfer_refusal", "label": "Unstamped units refuse transfer", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "L34", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "While a unit is unstamped the creator bypass is still live on it, so transferring it would leave the edition unsealed and forgeable."}, {"id": "readme_build_and_release", "label": "Build & release (gradlew assembleDebug, support/release.sh)", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "L36-L42", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "readme_lineage", "label": "Lineage (scaffolded from sibling apps)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "L44-L48", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Nothing was reinvented: shell/rendering/txn-builder/history from apks/utxo, hardened NodeApi from apks/pandadex, newest minimaapi.aar from apks/base/dist, StateNFT engine from mds/statenft-suite/android, QR writer from apks/nftstudio."}, {"id": "readme_apks_utxo", "label": "apks/utxo (shell, rendering stack, txn builder, history)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "L46", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "readme_apks_pandadex_nodeapi", "label": "Hardened NodeApi from apks/pandadex", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "L47", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "readme_apks_base_dist_aar", "label": "apks/base/dist minimaapi.aar (content:// large-response hand-off)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "README.md", "source_location": "L47", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The content:// hand-off exists because broadcas